                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="362 797 362 810 2128 804 2130 789 2128 763 2099 752 2097 752 2095 752 2093 752 2070 761 1897 752 1895 752 1745 761 1707 752 1705 752 1703 752 1701 752 1700 752 1684 763 1652 753 1651 753 1649 753 1594 763 1560 753 1558 753 1557 753 1555 753 1523 763 1484 753 1482 753 1480 753 1478 753 1447 763 360 763 362 797"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="like a raven. When he is close to the corpse, he bends down and pretends"/>
                    </TextLine>

